/*
==============================================================================
CATEGORIES & TAGS REFERENCE GUIDE
==============================================================================

CATEGORIES:
- Auto-Cap (Capitalization & standard abbreviations)
    * Tags: vei team, vision and seeing, converging and diverging, imaging, lids, ocular findings and conditions, CL, general and medical
- Refractive (Spectacle & Contact Lens Rx, Fit, Hygiene, and Modalities)
    * Tags: Spec, PAL, Bifocal, Myopia Management, Presbyopia, Ergonomics, CL Fit, CL Care, CL Names
- Assessment and Plan (Clinical plans, patient education, counseling, orders, management)
    * Tags: Plan, Vision, Communication, Medication, Orders, Patient Education, Section Header, Billing
- Exam Elements (Clinical findings, objective tests, exam notes, imaging)
    * Tags: CL History, OSD, Posterior Segment, Dilation, Imaging, Lens, Lids, Conjunctiva, Anterior Chamber

TRIGGER TYPES:
- "Standard"       : Requires ending character (Space, Tab, Enter, etc.) -> Hotstring format: ::input
- "Auto"           : Fires automatically upon completion -> Hotstring format: :*:input
- "SendOS"         : Injects finding to OD and OS via SendOS() -> Hotstring format: :*:input
- "DxHeaderEnter"  : Inserts underlined header + Enter via DxHeaderEnter() -> Hotstring format: :*:input
- "PrintRx"        : Sends optional text and triggers PrintRx() automation -> Hotstring format: :*:input
==============================================================================
*/
